o you can use MSAA for visionOS immersive rendering.\r\n\r\nDepends on\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109975\r\n\r\nand \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/78598\r\n\r\nOnly the last commit in this PR is meaningful. Other commits are cherrypicked from the two PRs above.\r\n\r\nThis is a working implementation. I put it here in case someone needs it. This is not ready for merge.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109975 implements immersive rendering on visionOS. But MSAA does not work, because depth buffer is not correctly resolved.\r\n\r\nDepth resolve is a long standing issue. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/78598 implements depth resolve for vulkan. This PR implements depth resolve for metal.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Dependency on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109975 can be detached if someone can provide a better use case to test MSAA depth resolve on metal.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9548448620,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAACOSHDbA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine